# Local app catalog: the repo ships an EMPTY skeleton (apps live in a
# separate private repo). apps.json is tracked via a skip-worktree bit —
# your working copy never gets staged. To intentionally update the repo's
# skeleton: git update-index --no-skip-worktree apps.json
